# GitHub CLI broker token
#
# GH_TOKEN here is given only to the GitHub CLI broker, which runs in its own
# container next to the capsule. The agent never sees this file or the token:
# inside the capsule `gh` forwards allowlisted commands to the broker
# (runtime/gh-broker/allowlist.txt).
#
# Setting GH_TOKEN enables the broker for every run (disable per run with --no-gh-broker).
# Do not put GH_TOKEN in secrets/.env: that file is passed to the agent directly.
#
# 推奨: fine-grained PAT、対象 repository を限定、有効期限あり、必要な権限のみ
#       （例: Issues: Read and write、Pull requests: Read and write、Metadata: Read）
# https://github.com/settings/personal-access-tokens
# GH_TOKEN=

# Repositories the broker lets commands target (comma-separated OWNER/NAME).
# --repo values, `repo view OWNER/NAME` and the repository inferred from the
# capsule's origin remote must be in this list; with exactly one entry it is
# also the default. Unset = any repository the token can access.
# 推奨: 使う repository だけを書く（research-harness の github.repo と同じ値）
# GH_BROKER_REPOS=owner/name
